      "section_type": "risk_factors",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 1A > GENERAL RISKS",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 1A",
      "category": "GENERAL RISKS",
      "subheading": null,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Our global workforce is predominantly non-unionized, although we do have some employees in the U.S. and internationally who are represented by unions or works councils.",
      "char_start": 70218,
      "char_end": 70386,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          70571,
