      "section_key": "part-ii-item-1a",
      "section_type": "risk_factors",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 1A > GENERAL RISKS",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 1A",
      "category": "GENERAL RISKS",
      "subheading": null,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "In addition, our international growth strategy includes certain markets, the developing nature of which presents several risks, including deterioration of social, political, labor, or economic conditions in a country or region, and difficulties in staffing and managing foreign operations.",
      "char_start": 67442,
      "char_end": 67731,
      "raw_spans": [
